[[File:Map040.png|center|350px]]
'''Demon of Deciliter Bay''' (デシリットル湾の魔物, ''Deshirittoru no Mamono'', '''Evil Spirit of Deciliter Bay''') is the 8th sub-chapter of [[Zero Legends]], and the 106th sub-chapter overall. It was introduced in [[Version 13.0 Update|Version 13.0]] and is available up to {{2c}} difficulty.

==Difficulty==
This sub-chapter is overall easier than those before it, so you should not stress over it. The only significantly hard stage here is [[1 + 2 = Tor]], which has a variety of [[:Category:Floating Enemies|Floating Enemies]] including three [[Teacher Bun Bun]]s, three [[Othom]]s and a [[Golem Sunfish]], making for a very tense stage. The only other notable stage is [[The Farthest Point]], a fight against two [[Bakoo]]s, although it isn't the hardest stage.

As this sub-chapter came out during the same update [[Ultra Form]]s did, some of the stages appear to have been designed around them. [[Pursuit of Understanding]] becomes quite easy if you have [[Oda Nobunaga (Uber Rare Cat)|Phantasmal Nobunaga]] due to his [[Counter-Surge]] and ability to freeze [[:Category:Aku Enemies|Aku]], 1 + 2 = Tor becomes a cakewalk if you have [[Windy (Uber Rare Cat)|Ultimate Windy α]], and [[Isosceles Valley]] is significantly easier with [[Dioramos (Uber Rare Cat)|Ascendant Dioramos]]. Overall, an interesting sub-chapter.
{{LegendDiff|120}}

==New Features==
This sub-chapter introduces 3 enemies to Zero Legends:
*[[Dark Cyclone]]: A [[:Category:Floating Enemies|Floating]]/[[:Category:Dark Enemies|Dark]] [[:Category:Cyclones|Cyclone]] from [[Attack on D-Cyclone (Expert)|Heaven of Darkness]]. Has very high health and DPS and a 20% chance to knockback cats, but deals relatively low damage per hit and gets knocked back up to 10 times.
*[[Bears Be Back]]: A [[:Category:Red Enemies|Red]]/[[:Category:Floating Enemies|Floating]]/[[:Category:Dark Enemies|Dark]]/[[:Category:Angel Enemies|Angel]]/[[:Category:Alien Enemies|Alien]]/[[:Category:Zombie Enemies|Zombie]] enemy from the [[Bears Be Back (Monthly Event)|Bears Be Back]] event. They don't hit hard, but have impressive health, movement speed and range, with a rapid, three-part attack that can inflict Knockback, Freeze, Slow, Weaken and/or Warp.
*[[Bakoo]]: The [[:Category:Advent Bosses|Advent Boss]] of [[Bombergirl (Deadly)|Deeply Dreaming]], this slow-moving Dark enemy constantly freezes all units within an enormous range should a unit trigger her attack, which occurs at 180 range. Like Dark Cyclone, she suffers from having 10 knockbacks.

